      "description": "A police officer is positioned centrally in the frame, holding a handgun with both hands and aiming it directly at the viewer. His expression is intense and focused. The background is plain and dark brown, isolating the subject. The text 'where is the black guy?' is overlaid at the top and bottom of the image, creating a confrontational and racially charged context.",
