      "description": "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that Black people are disproportionately associated with criminal behavior, which is a widely recognized and historically rooted form of racial prejudice. This stereotype is used to imply that Black individuals are inherently dangerous or criminal, thereby perpetuating systemic racism.",
