      "instance_name": "racialized_hostility",
      "label": "hostile racialized assumption",
      "description": "The image and text together convey a hostile and racially charged emotion, implying that the absence of a Black person is significant and that their presence would be expected or feared, reinforcing the stereotype that Black people are inherently dangerous or criminal. The officer’s intense, focused expression and the confrontational text create a sense of aggression and prejudice.",
